.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.swp

# Obsidian is a local viewing tool, not tracked content (David, 2026-07-24):
# per-vault settings/plugins/UI state at the project root (when the project
# folder is opened as a vault), and the legacy Cowork/ copy-based vault until
# it is retired.
.obsidian/
Cowork/
_to_delete/

# Generated binaries from the Design/_build toolchain (David, 2026-08-09):
# the .md maps are the living copies; PNG renders and the .docx snapshot are
# rebuildable in one command (see Design/_build/README.md) and stay untracked.
Design/_build/mmd/
Design/*.docx
